# Store listing copy — fixin for Android (Google Play)

---

Current features: on-device photo diagnosis, 2,262 repair
guides, voice/typed problem descriptions, history, projects, worksheets, PDF
export, ML chat assistant, two-factor sign-in, cloud backup **and restore**.

---

## Short description

```
Diagnose car, home and boat problems from a photo — and get the repair guide.
```

---

## Full description

```
fixin tells you what's wrong — and how to fix it.

Point your camera at a problem on your car, your home or your boat and fixin
identifies it in seconds. The analysis runs on your phone, so it works in a
driveway, a basement or a marina with no signal at all.

WHAT YOU GET WITH EVERY DIAGNOSIS

fixin doesn't stop at naming the fault. Each result comes with a repair guide
written for that specific problem: how to confirm it really is the issue, the
tools and parts you'll need, step-by-step instructions, safety warnings, a
realistic time estimate, and a clear line on when to stop and call a
professional.

There are over 2,200 of these guides. Not one per broad category — one per
specific fault. A boat autopilot that won't hold course gets different steps
than one with a leaking hydraulic ram.

DESCRIBE IT IN YOUR OWN WORDS

Photos don't capture everything. Add a spoken or typed note — "it clicks but
won't turn over" — and it travels with the diagnosis into your repair guide and
into the ML assistant, so the advice accounts for what you actually noticed.

KEEP TRACK OF THE WORK

Every diagnosis is saved to your history with its photo, confidence and
severity. Group related jobs into a Repair Project — "spring tune-up", "boat
haul-out" — and work through each repair as a step-by-step checklist you can
tick off, add notes to, and export as a PDF.

ASK FOLLOW-UP QUESTIONS

The built-in ML assistant answers questions about your specific diagnosis, so
you can ask "do I need to drain the coolant first?" without starting over.

YOUR WORK IS BACKED UP

Back your diagnoses up to your account and restore them on a new phone or after
a reinstall — complete with the diagnosis, severity and repair instructions, not
just the photo. Restoring never overwrites anything already on your device.

WHAT IT COVERS

Cars — engine, transmission, brakes, electrical, cooling, fuel, suspension,
steering, tyres and wheels, exhaust and emissions, HVAC, body and interior,
driver-assist systems and more.

Homes — plumbing, electrical, HVAC, roofing, foundation and structure, appliances,
water heaters, drainage, pests, pools and spas, septic and well systems, fire and
life safety, and more.

Boats — engines and outboards, sterndrives, fuel, bilge, hull, electrical,
shore power, plumbing, refrigeration, steering, rigging, corrosion, trailers,
trim tabs and more.

A free account includes a set number of diagnoses per day and per month.
Premiere and The One unlock more diagnoses, more detailed fault identification
and the full repair-guide library.

fixin is built by AM Solutions in Seattle.

fixin gives you the most likely cause and general repair guidance. It is not a
substitute for a qualified mechanic, electrician, plumber or marine technician.
Always follow the safety warnings in the guide, and stop and call a professional
for anything involving gas, structural damage, or work you aren't confident
doing safely.
```

---

## "What's new" — first Play release

```
Welcome to fixin.

Point your camera at a problem on your car, home or boat and get a likely
diagnosis in seconds — analysed on your phone, so it works without a signal.

Every diagnosis comes with a repair guide for that exact fault: what to check,
the tools you need, safety warnings and a time estimate. Over 2,200 guides.

Save to history, group repairs into projects, and work through them as a
step-by-step checklist.
```

---

## "What's new" — 1.4.1

```
More accurate severity ratings.

Serious problems — fuel, steering, hull, fire safety, structural — were being
rated "Low", which also held back their repair guides. Severity is now judged
properly across every category, so the guidance you get matches how urgent the
problem really is.

Confidence figures are calibrated too, and results the engine isn't sure about
are now flagged instead of shown as a single confident answer.
```

---

## "What's new" — 1.4.0

```
A new diagnosis engine, and guides for your exact problem.

Sapphire 4.0 retrains the on-device models and adds a Vision Transformer for
sharper calls across cars, boats and homes. Boats gain sterndrive, trailer,
propane, refrigeration and trim-tab coverage.

The guide library grew to over 2,200 — one per specific fault, not per category.

Also: two-factor sign-in, and restore your diagnoses from a backup on a new
phone.
```
